  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to boil.\n• Cook penne in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 12 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6233ccf83b46a357b06b1673/step-69bcf96e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice zucchini into thin half-moons.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6233ccf83b46a357b06b1673/step-5898bca5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini and capsicum until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to low and add brown sugar, all purpose seasoning, garlic seasoning and diced tomatoes. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6233ccf83b46a357b06b1673/step-0bc4ed97.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium. Add cooked pasta, mixed leaves, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) a good splash of pasta water and the butter to the sauce. Stir to combine. Season with pepper.\n• Divide pasta between bowls. Top with crumbled fetta to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6233ccf83b46a357b06b1673/step-0aadd967.jpg"
    }
  ]
